translate chinese olivia_fr_scene_7e5b4fcf:

    # mc "Hey… relax, okay? You’re way too tense."
    mc "嘿……放松点，好吗？你太紧张了。"

# game/Story01.rpy:9014
translate chinese olivia_fr_scene_906e07bf:

    # mc "If something doesn’t feel right here—"
    mc "要是这儿有什么让你不舒服——"

# game/Story01.rpy:9016
translate chinese olivia_fr_scene_7973c403:

    # h "N-no, no! I like it, I really do! It’s just…"
    h "不……不是！我喜欢，真的喜欢！只是……"

# game/Story01.rpy:9017
translate chinese olivia_fr_scene_798eaa56:

    # h "It’s just… you’re the first people, strangers, who’ve been this kind to me."
    h "只是……你们是第一批对我这么好的陌生人。"

# game/Story01.rpy:9018
translate chinese olivia_fr_scene_8157ed36:

    # h "I keep waiting for the catch… but I can’t seem to find one."
    h "我一直在等有什么猫腻……但好像找不到。"

