    # "Sector 7-S."
    "7-S区。"

# game/Story01.rpy:9234
translate chinese final2_4f441c23:

    # Mi "The tracks… lead here."
    Mi "脚印……通向这里。"

# game/Story01.rpy:9237
translate chinese final2_8094581f:

    # h "Tracks? Hey, Mir… you sure we should keep going?"
    h "脚印？嘿，米儿……你确定还要往前走？"

